%S A398959 1,2,15,131,1360,15133,175809,2103277,25715277,319810319,4032748840
%N A398959 Number of free polyforms with n cells in the Josehedron honeycomb.
%C A398959 Polyforms in the Josehedron honeycomb (see A398957 for the definition), counted up to the full order-24 point group of the honeycomb (12 proper and 12 improper symmetries; the tiling is achiral).
%C A398959 The cubic-honeycomb analog of this sequence is A038119, which the same enumerator reproduces exactly for n <= 10.
%H A398959 Mathias Bernhard, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.07160">The Josehedron: A space-filling plesiohedron based on the Fischer-Koch S Triply Periodic Minimal Surface</a>, arXiv:2604.07160 [cs.CG], 2026.
%Y A398959 Cf. A398957 (fixed), A398958 (one-sided), A385028, A397708, A397709; A038119 (cubic analog).
%K A398959 nonn,more,new
%O A398959 1,2
